          .proof
            %h6 Proof
            %p
              We check the
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+property"} universal property
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cocone"} cocone
              under the diagram must have as tip a
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/distributive+monoidal+category"} distributive monoidal category
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo ∫
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi C
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \int \mathbf{C}
              both from a monoidal and from a cocartesian category.
            %p
              This means that a general
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cocone"} cocone
              looks like the following solid diagram:
